        "url": "https://scvd.store/mcp/verifier",
        "description": "A second MCP door (scvd-x402-verifier) serving only read-only x402 verification tools under task-shaped names, on the same handlers as the store's full door, with no paid tool reachable. For a client that should never see a shelf.",
